  "description": "动态脚本解析、编译、执行，C#语法，支持表达式运算、多语句、变量、函数、while/for/if/foreach语句等，可自定义语法解析、自定义脚本语言；\n快速开始：\nvar script = new Script();\nvar result = script.Eval(\"int sum(int a, int b)=>a+b; int n=10; sum(n,5)\");\nAssert.AreEqual(15, result);",
